<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css">
    <title>Product Landing</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header id="header">
      <img id="header-img" alt="headphone" src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/937/937363.png"/>
      <h2 class="sound-sphere">Sound Sphere</h2>
      <nav id="nav-bar">
        <ul>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#sound">Features</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#video">How It Works</a></li>
          <li><a class="nav-link" href="#headphones">Prices</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </header>
    <section>
      <h1>Sound that Moves You</h1>
      <form id="form" action="https://www.freecodecamp.com/email-submit">
      <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="Enter Email" required/>
      <input class="email-button" name="email"id="submit" type="submit"/>
    
</form>
    </section>
    <section>
      <div id="sound">
        <img class="sound-icon" alr="sound" src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/3155/3155343.png"/>
      <div class="premium"><h3>Premium Sound</h3>
      <p>Our headphones are built with high-fidelity drivers that deliver crystal-clear audio and deep bass. Whether you're gaming, working, or relaxing, you’ll enjoy a rich and immersive sound experience.</p>
      </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shipping" >
        <img class="delivery-icon" alt="delivery" src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/10053/10053720.png" />
        <div><h3>Fast & Secure Shipping</h3>
      <p>We ship your headphones quickly and safely with tracking included. Expect timely delivery and hassle-free returns if you're not completely satisfied.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="quality" >
        <img class="quality-icon" src="https://cdn-icons-png.flaticon.com/128/2092/2092852.png" alt="quality" />
        <div><h3>Quality Assurance</h3>
      <p>Every pair of headphones goes through a rigorous testing process to ensure flawless performance, comfort, and durability — so you get nothing but the best.</p></div>
      </div>

    </section>




    <section>
      <iframe id="video" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/WSX8PLC_jRM" frameborder="0" 
          allow="accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture" 
          allowfullscreen></iframe>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div id="headphones">
      <div class="headphone1">
        <div class="name1"><b>JLab Epic Sport ANC 3</b>
        <h3 class="price">£69.99</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="description1">
          <p>Secure earhook fit for active use</p>
            <p>Active noise cancellation</p>
            <p>Up to 12 hours of battery life</p>
              <p>Ideal for fitness enthusiasts on a budget</p><br>
        </div>
        <button class="select">SELECT</button>
      </div>

      <div class="headphone2">
        <div class="name2"><b>Sony WH-1000XM5</b>
        <h3 class="price">£269</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="description2">
          <p>Exceptional noise cancellation</p>
            <p>Up to 30 hours of battery life with noise cancellation</p>
            <p>Bluetooth 5.2 connectivity with multipoint support</p>
              <p>Over-ear design for maximum comfort</p>
        </div>
        <button class="select">SELECT</button>
      </div>

      <div class="headphone3">
        <div class="name3"><b>Apple AirPods Max</b>
        <h3 class="price">£494</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="description3">
          <p>High-fidelity audio quality</p>
            <p>Effective noise cancellation</p>
            <p>Up to 20 hours of battery life with ANC and Transparency mode active</p>
              <p>Seamless integration with the Apple ecosystem</p>
        </div>
        <button class="select">SELECT</button>
      </div>


      </div>


    </section>
    <footer></footer>
    
  </body>
</html>
